--- !u!114 &1713099863
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1713099860}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2ca886655df94d7aa63b0d2381ac1e36, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  postDialogue0:
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081557
    - rid: 7033667370497081558
    - rid: 7033667370497081552
    - rid: 7033667370497081559
    - rid: 7033667370497081554
    - rid: 7033667370497081560
  dialogue1:
  - content: Rocky moves Jackie onto the stretcher, and Kade tends to the dressing
      on her leg.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081413
  - content: "You\u2019re Jackie..."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081409
  - content: You know her?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081423
  - content: "She\u2019s Ailin\u2019s daughter."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081427
    - rid: 7033667370497081428
  - content: "Didn\u2019t think I\u2019d see her again, here of all places..."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: You... you knew my mom?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081429
  - content: Knew her? We were her team, kid.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081430
  - content: "What? Then... why are you here? Everyone... everyone thinks you\u2019re
      dead!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081432
  - content: Kade and Rocky share a long, heavy look.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081433
  - content: "... It\u2019s a long, hard story, Jackie. Let\u2019s get you to camp
      first."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081434
    - rid: 7033667370497081435
  - content: Is she... is she here with you?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081436
  - content: "... No. She\u2019s not here."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081437
  - content: What? Why? What happened?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081438
  - content: We were betrayed, and we... lost her, kid.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081439
  - content: Tsk. Wording please.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081440
    - rid: 7033667370497081441
  - content: "We were separated. We don\u2019t know where she is or whether she\u2019s
      dead or alive."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081442
  - content: That was supposed to be better?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081443
  - content: "Betrayed? By who? Tell me! I have to\u2014"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081444
    - rid: 7033667370497081453
  - content: "No. Absolutely not. Look at you. You\u2019re half-dead, and already
      looking for another fight."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081445
  - content: "Please. Don\u2019t make this any harder for us and yourself. Not until
      you get better."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ... Okay.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081446
  postDialogue1:
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081551
  dialogue2:
  - content: "... How\u2019s Ives? Is she doing alright?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081454
    - rid: 7033667370497081460
  - content: "... She\u2019s... she\u2019s fine."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081465
  - content: Good. Good to hear. She tended to draw the short straw in life, you
      know?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081466
    - rid: 7033667370497081467
  - content: Our disappearance... It must have been hard on her. We were all she
      had.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081468
  - content: "So why didn\u2019t you come back to her? She blames herself for what
      she thinks happened to you!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081469
  - content: "... I don\u2019t doubt she does. Even though I wish she wouldn\u2019t.
      But you\u2019ll see why we\u2019re out here, soon enough."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081470
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081471
  - content: Until then, just rest.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081472
  postDialogue2:
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081565
  dialogue3:
  - content: Welcome to camp. Get comfortable here.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081478
  - content: "Hey, a new face! Who\u2019s\u2014"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081484
    - rid: 7033667370497081631
    - rid: 7033667370497081632
    - rid: 7033667370497081486
    - rid: 7033667370497081633
  - content: Wait. No way! Is that Little Jackie?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Do I... know you?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081487
  - content: "It\u2019s me! Uncle Jay! Wow. You\u2019ve grown so much! I haven\u2019t
      seen you since you were, well, little!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081488
  - content: "Heh. Jay\u2019s got a good memory. Doesn\u2019t forget a face. Or anything,
      for that matter."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081489
  - content: "I\u2019ll leave you with him, feel free to ask him any questions. He\u2019ll
      know the details best."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Hey Ari! Get our guest a flask of water.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081490
  - content: On it, Cap!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba10bd187431a442890fc8138cfaa1e2, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081491
    - rid: 7033667370497081569
    - rid: 7033667370497081570
  - content: Ari hands Jackie a flask of water and leaves. As he turns, Jackie gets
      a good look at his face.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081492
  - content: "One side of it is covered in crystalline, discolored scars, and the
      eye is milky white. Jackie can\u2019t help but stare."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Is... is he okay?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081493
  - content: "Oh, Ari? Yeah, he\u2019s doing better now! Things haven\u2019t been
      easy for any of us, but we make do!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081494
  - content: "... You\u2019re all NITES, right?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081495
  - content: "How did you all end up here? And why didn\u2019t you come back?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Well, that\u2019s a question and a half. A million different choices
      that all brought us here."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081496
    - rid: 7033667370497081497
  - content: Take Ari, for instance.  I remember the day he handed me his application
      for the team.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: His older sister was killed in a transport accident in the Tundra. Bad
      planning, rough route, no backup.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: He was a small guy at the time, and so I asked him why exactly he wanted
      to join the team.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: He told me he wanted to make sure no one got left behind again.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: I could feel his resolve through the application as I took it from him.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081498
  - content: And so I put him on the team. Among the many others who each had their
      own reasons for joining.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081499
  - content: Then there was the day where I made the wrong call.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: It was selfish. We were about to turn back to camp when I noticed something
      off between the environment and how I remembered it.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: First time I felt like I misremembered something.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: The team agreed to investigate, and we came upon the crystals for the
      first time.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "That\u2019s when we were attacked. They were hardy creatures, but it
      was nothing we hadn\u2019t seen before."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: But those serums you carry? They react like crazy near the crystals.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Most members on the team had already taken a couple of doses at the
      time.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: And when a crystal shattered during the fight, it all happened instantly.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "I remember Ari\u2019s skin flash-crystalizing, his flesh tearing from
      his bones and hardening as this violet energy ran through his veins."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "He screamed, but it didn\u2019t sound like the Ari we knew."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "He turned into a monster. Couldn\u2019t recognize us anymore, and started
      lashing out at anyone in his path."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Only a handful of scouts and I made it out.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "But yeah, we don\u2019t dwell on that anymore. After all, we\u2019re
      doing much better now!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081500
  - content: "The reason we\u2019re here is because Kade is looking for a way to
      reverse the effects of the altered serums. Her research progresses more and
      more every day."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "We managed to track down and rescue many of my old team, and slowly
      they\u2019ve begun to heal. But there\u2019s still more out there. So we\u2019ll
      be here as long as they are."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "I\u2019m... aware."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081501
  dialogue4:
  - content: ... Can I ask you something, Jay?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Shoot.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081573
  - content: ... How did you move on?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081574
  - content: From knowing that... that your decision, something for your sake, ended
      up hurting the people close to you.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Oh.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081575
    - rid: 7033667370497081576
  - content: I hear you.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Some people move on by \u201Cletting go\u201D or \u201Cforgetting.\u201D
      But, well, I can\u2019t. I\u2019ll remember every single second of it forever."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: For the first couple of years after, I was a complete mess.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Because of what happened, but also of what would happen <i>next</i>.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: What do you mean?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081577
  - content: "When Ailin\u2019s team found us, Kade started her research."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081578
  - content: She eventually figured out how to reverse it, to stabilize them.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: And I was <i>terrified</i>. I mean, truly, truly afraid.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ... Of what?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081579
  - content: Afraid of them, my team. Of what they would say once they woke up.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081580
  - content: I was their leader and I made the call. And I left with only a few scratches.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: But the others.... Take Ari for example. He was a monster for <i>months</i>.
      I was so ready for him to hate me.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "The day we reversed Ari\u2019s transformation, I could barely bring
      myself to face him."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: He woke up, looked at his hands, then around the room, and spotted me.
      And he ran over.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Threw his arms around me so tight I thought my ribs would crack.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "He wasn\u2019t angry?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081581
  - content: "No. He was <i>ecstatic</i>. Just kept saying, \u201CYou\u2019re alive!
      You\u2019re safe!\u201D"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081582
    - rid: 7033667370497081583
  - content: "I... I didn\u2019t get it. I asked him, \u201CAri, how can you... after
      what I did to you?\u201D"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081584
  - content: "And I\u2019ll never forget his answer. Not that I could, even if I
      wanted to, but you get the point."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "He looked me right in my guilty, stupid face and said, \u201CJay, I
      joined the team to stop people from being left behind.\u201D"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "\u201CYou didn\u2019t leave me behind. You came back for me. To save
      me.\u201D"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: It was then that I realized... no one from my old team blamed me.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: They knew the risks and still chose to be scouts.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: They chose to follow me to investigate, because they respected me and
      were just as curious.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: And in the end, they were just... happy we were all still breathing.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "But... what if I don\u2019t <i>want</i> people to risk getting hurt
      for me?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081585
  - content: Too bad!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081586
    - rid: 7033667370497081587
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081588
  - content: "No, really. It\u2019s too bad, haha. You don\u2019t get to make that
      decision for them, Jackie."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081589
  - content: "That\u2019s <i>their</i> choice and in the end, you can\u2019t control
      that. Trust me, you\u2019ll be all sorts of bent out of shape if you try."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081590
  - content: "Because telling them that their mission, their reasons, aren\u2019t
      as important as your fears?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "<i>That\u2019s</i> what hurts them more. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "If you\u2019re concerned, you talk to them. You work with them. But
      you don\u2019t go around \u201Cprotecting\u201D them from their own decisions."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "That\u2019s just not what equals do."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "... But that\u2019s... so messed up. I feel..."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081591
  - content: Powerless? Yeah. Welcome to caring about people.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081592
    - rid: 7033667370497081593
  - content: "Sometimes caring just means letting go. If that\u2019s what they decide
      makes them happy."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081594
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081595
  - content: Rocky and Kade walk back over, their expressions grim.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081596
    - rid: 7033667370497081597
    - rid: 7033667370497081618
    - rid: 7033667370497081598
  - content: "Hey Jay. Kade ran her sensors. There\u2019s a massive Amplitude concentration
      at the peak of the mountain."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081601
  - content: "The \u201Cfrog\u201D story is real. Have you seen anything in that
      sector?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "What? That\u2019s impossible. I sent Alpha and Bravo down there not
      two weeks ago. They did a full routine sweep of the routes up."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081602
  - content: "... I\u2019ll organize another search party."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Let me come. I can guide you.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081603
  - content: "No. Not a chance. You\u2019re resting."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081604
  - content: "No more arguments. You\u2019ve done enough. Trust Jay\u2019s team."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081605
  - content: But...!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081606
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ... Alright.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  postDialogue4:
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081608
    - rid: 7033667370497081611
    - rid: 7033667370497081612
    - rid: 7033667370497081609
    - rid: 7033667370497081610
  dialogue5:
  - content: Among the several tanks within the lab, in one of them floats an individual
      attached to pulsating tubes and humming machinery.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081607
  - content: Cam stands nearby reviewing several bright monitors.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "That\u2019s a relief, the crystalline implants are going smoothly."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081613
  - content: "Once they\u2019re complete, then the reversion process can begin."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Looks like I\u2019ll have some time to kill in the meantime though..."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Right, I should check-up on Jackie, she hasn\u2019t sent an update
      in three days."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081614
  - content: She better have a good reason...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Cam taps his console, initiating a call.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081615
  - content: "Damn, I can\u2019t reach her. I\u2019ll try Ives."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 520
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081616
    - rid: 7033667370497081617
  dialogue6:
  - content: Hey, kiddo. How are things?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 518
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081623
    - rid: 7033667370497081645
    - rid: 7033667370497081646
    - rid: 7033667370497081622
    - rid: 7033667370497081647
  - content: Good. Fine. Uh... have you heard from Jackie by chance?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081624
    - rid: 7033667370497081625
  - content: No.... Why?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081626
    - rid: 7033667370497081627
  - content: "It\u2019s just\u2026 I told her to keep me updated on something she
      was doing."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081628
    - rid: 7033667370497081629
  - content: "She hasn\u2019t checked in for three days now. So... I\u2019m worried
      she went back on her word."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "... I\u2019ll ask around. Give me a sec."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081630
  dialogue7:
  - content: "Shoot. Nobody\u2019s seen her."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "She\u2019s been AWOL from roll call for about 72 hours. And they can\u2019t
      launch a search without a location."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Damnation... okay. Well, before she left, she gave me coordinates. Well...
      I made her.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081634
    - rid: 7033667370497081635
  - content: Ah. Smart thinking.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081636
  - content: "We\u2019ll be arriving at the Tundra camp by the end of the day. I\u2019ll
      draft a plan. We\u2019ll find her."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Good luck. And Ives... be careful, alright? Don\u2019t push yourself
      and watch your symptoms."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081637
    - rid: 7033667370497081638
  - content: "Yeah, thanks kiddo. Don\u2019t worry. I\u2019ll be fine. See you."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081639
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081640
  dialogue8:
  - content: 'Crystalline transfusion complete. Current reversion progress: 2%.'
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f52cacb6579084995aefad6ecb112eb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081642
  - content: "Great, let\u2019s make sure this goes smoothly."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081643
    - rid: 7033667370497081644
  - content: We wish to see you back. <i>Ailin</i>.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7033667370497081648
